	(text "PIN BASLIGI (nRF24L01 modul uyumlu 2x4, 2.54 mm)\nVCC 1.9..3.6 V (tipik 3.3 V), TX tepe akimi ~130 mA.\nGiris lojik 5V toleransli (nRF24L01+); RFX2401C kontrol pinleri en fazla 3.6 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6062be0c-0a27-5996-84c4-73b0c2c2ee96"))
	(text "nRF24L01+  (Nordic PS v1.0, Sekil 32 / Tablo 29)\nEslestirme L1/L2/L3/C3..C6 datasheet ref. degerleri.\nEP (pad 21) Nordic onerisiyle bagli degil.\nC1/C2 = 2*CL - Cpcb - Cpin  (CL=12pF -> 22pF)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "be6ee712-f6d6-5753-8e68-aef44cf14616"))
	(text "RFX2401C PA/LNA (Skyworks 204359C)\nTX:  TXEN=1 (VDD_PA, nRF TX iken 1.8 V)\nRX:  TXEN=0, RXEN=1 (CE ile; nRF RX modunda CE=1)\nKapali: CE=0 -> ~0 uA\n5 V MCU'da CE 5V olur: R3 DNP, R4 tak (RX surekli acik)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 182.88 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6178878a-120f-5e8e-8e25-a1f2b7e53be5"))
	(text "Harmonik filtre: Skyworks ref. Opsiyon 1 (ayrik pi LC).\nC15 (0.3pF) ANT pinine en yakin yerlesir.\nANTEN SECIMI:  chip anten = R6 0R takili, R5 bos (varsayilan)\n               U.FL       = R5 0R takili, R6 bos\nC20/L6/C21 chip anten pi eslestirme yeri (kartta VNA ile ayarlanir)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6af8234a-fea6-540a-bf78-d93c70195331"))
